WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Admin: add a ChatGPT model to your existing LiteLLM proxy.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
Check your existing ChatGPT login. New users run codex login.

00:10.000 --> 00:21.000
Point Codex at the standard /v1 URL. Read the gateway key from the environment.

00:21.000 --> 00:27.000
Start Codex and send a prompt using your subscription.

00:27.000 --> 00:36.000
The live response streams through LiteLLM.

00:36.000 --> 00:44.000
The gateway records token usage under the developer's virtual key.
